{"steam_appid":3196440,"steam_name":"Vacation Cafe Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3196440/1035095362/98186d7cba313f62cfba6ee98ac13f12d2157031/1787217697/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1787251698","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257403872/6db7441beb0eb5d7acc149f72adfb27acfaf2e1c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1787251698","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/ss_b4b1b07046b0c9cc3893a31815769df2046cd7e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787306679","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/ss_012bf0b9d3f173d341207388f3742d2a8effcb9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787306679","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/ss_7f8cc9fc350d4d0b8b942946568ed99e0a0e5032.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787306679","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/ss_1d24d5c0f9dd2144925a4588704cff46cb07f900.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787306679","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/ss_5c94f243592ca1fefed37a56a6dd5c7bb8505417.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787306679"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook Authentic Cuisine:</strong> Master traditional Italian recipes through engaging mini-games to prepare pizza, pasta, bruschetta, and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/f929283ed3de112f49878df97116c821.poster.avif?t=1787306679\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/f929283ed3de112f49878df97116c821.webm?t=1787306679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/f929283ed3de112f49878df97116c821.mp4?t=1787306679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop Your Restaurant:</strong> Invest your earnings to buy new equipment, expand your menu, and improve your restaurant's interior and ambiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/ecedce52c987aa6f3cf3bb28ddd6b3fb.poster.avif?t=1787306679\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/ecedce52c987aa6f3cf3bb28ddd6b3fb.webm?t=1787306679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/ecedce52c987aa6f3cf3bb28ddd6b3fb.mp4?t=1787306679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World:</strong> Visit nearby shops and locations like wineries and farms to discover new opportunities and add unique touches to your cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/8996d27006830ac308e9fa7d2f1c6305.poster.avif?t=1787306679\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/8996d27006830ac308e9fa7d2f1c6305.webm?t=1787306679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/8996d27006830ac308e9fa7d2f1c6305.mp4?t=1787306679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Your Customers:</strong> Take orders, serve meals and drinks, and delight your customers with top-notch service to build a loyal following.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Combine management skills, culinary mastery, and the zest of exploration to build your dream gastronomic business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a flavorful journey and turn your vacation cafe into the most beloved spot in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an Italian vacation cafe owner and craft the ultimate dining experience! In ‘<strong>Vacation Cafe Simulator</strong>,’ you'll manage a cozy restaurant, cook delicious Italian dishes, and serve your guests while immersing yourself in the authentic atmosphere of Italy.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Alice Games"],"publishers":["Alice Games"],"release_date":"Aug 20, 2026"}